              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“But I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", am tearing down what I have built and pulling up what I have planted. I will do this to the entire earth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
